> │ ▼ │ ▼ │
>
> │ GC sees sub\'s scope │ Sub sees GC\'s shared tasks, │
>
> │ progress in their │ schedule, and their own │
>
> │ project dashboard │ scope in their dashboard │
>
> └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

