**5. Data Sharing Permissions Model**

When initiating a connection, the GC selects which event types flow
across the bridge. The Sub reviews and can negotiate before accepting.
Permissions are stored in the tenant_connections.permissions JSONB
column.

**5.1 Default Permissions (Pre-Populated for GC)**

  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Event Type**           **Default   **Can be     **Notes**
                           ON**        Turned Off** 
  ------------------------ ----------- ------------ ---------------------------
  task_completed /         ON          No           Core collaboration ---
  uncompleted                                       cannot be disabled

  inspection_scheduled &   ON          No           Core compliance --- cannot
  result                                            be disabled

  daily_report_submitted   ON          Yes          GC may not need sub daily
                                                    reports for small scopes

  invoice_submitted &      ON          No           Core financial workflow ---
  approved                                          cannot be disabled

  invoice_paid             ON          No           Sub must know when they\'re
                                                    paid

  rfi_created & responded  ON          Yes          Can be disabled if all RFIs
                                                    go through GC PM only

  submittal_uploaded &     ON          Yes          Relevant only if sub has
  reviewed                                          submittals in their scope

  change_order_issued &    ON          No           Core contract management
  responded                                         --- cannot be disabled

  lien_waiver_requested &  ON          No           Core closeout compliance
  signed                                            --- cannot be disabled

  message_sent             ON          Yes          Collaborative communication
                                                    --- on by default

  Sub\'s crew time totals  OFF         Yes          GC sees total hours only,
  (hours only)                                      not individual employee
                                                    names or rates

  Sub\'s individual labor  OFF         N/A ---      Never shared --- Sub\'s
  costs                                always off   internal cost data is
                                                    private

  Sub\'s profit margin     OFF         N/A ---      Never shared --- Sub\'s
                                       always off   financial privacy is
                                                    absolute
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

